INFO 2026-04-17 11:32:04,872 accounts.api_io [request_id=E6588D7F-2D06-4517-9C71-2BAF737851FD] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=5 bytes=6166 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMTdUMDU6MTc6MTcuOTQ0Mzc0KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMDUwIn0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "a593f37d-96f3-48bb-a852-0403e55cf999", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "？？？", "client_message_id": "4ae501ab-f856-4ad2-971f-0ee2426fe184", "server_message_id": "44d86b12-23d3-4731-87c8-29f9be850375", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T05:11:30.787000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T05:11:34.176012+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "3C1A064F-8F6B-434A-8D27-332D809D4438", "text": "{\"ocr_text\":\"C02\",\"file_id\":201,\"file_uuid\":\"CA980CB7-D2DD-4F57-9CAE-15FE3B2DA34F\",\"original_name\":\"照片 1\",\"mime_type\":\"application\\/octet-stream\",\"file_md5\":\"e0ff07f171a7de66812fc6ab1c954842\"}", "type": "image_url"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "a593f37d-96f3-48bb-a852-0403e55cf999", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你可以补充说明具体想咨询的问题哦，比如用药建议、健康解读、日程安排等，我会为你解答。", "client_message_id": "c23c4b79-4dc7-4800-a840-af53b7413ff6", "server_message_id": "c773f19b-a0e6-4820-bd04-44c48e218feb", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T05:11:34.216000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T05:11:34.183247+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "a593f37d-96f3-48bb-a852-0403e55cf999", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "报告解读", "client_message_id": "4f06a932-c57b-46f3-af2e-40567402b43d", "server_message_id": "d784eb47-3502-4fe2-be7b-5020a3bc156a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T05:17:11.437000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T05:17:17.916293+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "6B5EF10E-58FF-40F1-9C49-EDC72BA4D876", "text": "{\"file_id\":202,\"original_name\":\"照片 1\",\"mime_type\":\"application\\/octet-stream\",\"ocr_text\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\\n苏州市独墅湖医院\\n胃镜诊断报告单\\n姓名：赵道凯\\n性别：男\\n年龄：28 岁\\n申请科室：消化内科门诊\\n门诊号：0000349056\\n住院号：\\n床号：\\n病区：\\n检查项目：无痛电子胃镜（不含林醉费）\\n申请单号：260821105\\n①食管\\n2齿状线\\n③胃底\\n①胃体\\n⑤胃角\\n6胃窦\\n⑦十二指肠球部\\n⑧十二指肠降部\\n内镜所见：\\n食管：通过顺利，黏膜大致正常；\\n贵门：开合佳通畅；\\n胃底：黏膜正常；\\n胃体：见胆汁残留；\\n胃角：光整；\\n胃窦：黏膜红白相间，以红为主；\\n幽门：圆，开放好；\\n十二指肠球部及所见降部：未见明显异常。\\n诊断：\\n慢性非菱缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流\\n活检部位：\\n建议：\\n报告医生：健\\n审核医师：F26\\n报告时间：2026-02-10\\n备注：若有病理，请于3-5个工作日后在手机公众号上查询及去一楼或五楼的自助报告机取报告！\",\"file_md5\":\"b9e95229af6b8d1d5a88ba97e2eda3db\",\"file_uuid\":\"BF071630-AA84-4463-896A-8B2BDD731C92\"}", "type": "image_url"}, {"id": "4016F074-ED08-4A48-91FA-DE4FCD652626", "text": "{\"original_name\":\"照片 2\",\"file_id\":203,\"mime_type\":\"application\\/octet-stream\",\"ocr_text\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）\\n门（急）诊病历\\n姓名：赵道凯 性别：男 出生日期：1998\\/10\\/29 门诊号：0000349056\\n就诊时间：2026-02-06 10:16 就诊科室：口腔科门诊 初诊\\n主诉：要求口腔检查1天\\n现病史：今日来诊要求口腔检查\\n既往史：慢性疾病史：否认；其他：\\n其他病史：\\n过敏史：无\\n体温：°C脉搏：次\\/分 呼吸：次\\/分 血压：\\/ mmHg 意识状态：\\n主要症状和体征：\\n全身症状：口发热 口头痛口乏力 口肌肉酸痛口关节痛\\n呼吸道症状：口咽痛 口咳嗽 口咳痰 口流涕 口胸闷 口呼吸困难\\n消化道症状：口腹泻 口腹痛口呕吐\\n皮疹症状：口斑丘疹 口水泡疹 口针尖样皮疹 口焦痂\\n出血症状：口点瘀斑 口呕血 口咯血 口血尿 口血便 口结膜出血\\n神经系统症状：口发热伴惊厥 口肌无力 口视物模糊\\n口无上述症状\\n体格检查：\\n皮肤黏膜：未检\\n胸部：未检\\n肺脏及胸膜：未检\\n心脏：未检\\n腹部：未检\\n神经反射：未检\\n其他专科检查：38\\/48近中低位阻生，远中牙龈覆盖，龈红肿\\n辅助检查：\\n诊断：阻生牙 K01.100\\n处理措施：-\\n保持口腔卫生，建议择期拔除阻生牙。\\n第1页\",\"file_md5\":\"f82a2d0bac183618a928d31e9364211b\",\"file_uuid\":\"BCEF6112-8D93-40D0-B0F0-7477D33F97C5\"}", "type": "image_url"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "a593f37d-96f3-48bb-a852-0403e55cf999", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "请你上传需要解读的报告图片，我会为你进行解读分析。", "client_message_id": "e1bba0ee-0256-446d-8cda-7a7a196c25be", "server_message_id": "6aa62f1e-efcb-4cfc-90b5-82cdafc17cb1", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T05:17:17.969000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T05:17:17.944374+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "21DF71E4-1F43-45A1-8B2F-70E286854693", "text": "show_custom_message_card", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "01815D20-2A65-4147-98E0-87DA2E433A5B", "text": "[1] show_custom_message_card\n已展示上传/拍照卡片入口（report_photo），请继续引导用户上传材料。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "698E86A1-0C6F-44D3-80A2-E21CAA1E6B7B", "text": "正在使用工具：show_custom_message_card", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "37673DA1-304F-464F-AF8F-2A60407CF192", "text": "已展示上传/拍照卡片入口（report_photo），请继续引导用户上传材料。", "type": "operationalDescription"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
