b9c9-4088-936c-da5b7dbc1f0e", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "抱抱你 🫂 不开心的时候可以试试这些：\n\n**现在能做的**\n- 深呼吸 4-7-8（吸气4秒，屏息7秒，呼气8秒）\n- 喝杯水，站起来走动几分钟\n- 听首喜欢的歌或看看窗外的风景\n\n**想聊聊吗？**\n- 是什么让你不开心？说出来可能会好受点\n- 需要我帮你查些放松的方法，还是陪你随便聊聊？\n\n我在这里 🍀", "client_message_id": "09e1fd78-34ae-44af-b4fa-7b281961cb6a", "server_message_id": "0decf85f-7050-4d33-aa53-51cad518ed1b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-16T02:59:43.436000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-16T02:59:43.443228+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
