e": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "看看图片里面是什么", "client_message_id": "ed2daace-a444-4994-bccf-c56f6510b874", "server_message_id": "9c634bf0-815e-4bcd-a26a-9c9ca265317a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T05:08:21.304000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T05:08:27.456407+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "7C54584F-040A-4E63-A4D4-90A72547807E", "text": "{\"ocr_text\":\"12:20\\n：！！ 4G\\n8\\n9\\nMARTIN TUNGEVAAG\\n120w+\\nWicked Wonderland\\nTungevaag\\n关注\\n213人在听\\nの2\\nHQ VIP\\n原声\\nTo reappear on our front door\\n听伴奏\\n（9\\n01:17\\n03:37\\nC）\",\"file_id\":199,\"original_name\":\"照片 1\",\"file_md5\":\"0810b947ba5bafe40b199f2d646a283b\",\"file_uuid\":\"116AD101-55F6-406E-99FB-284E4EBDA273\",\"mime_type\":\"application\\/octet-stream\"}", "type": "image_url"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "3131b90f-fd0b-49da-a491-af171d142d05", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "请你点击上方卡片上传图片，我会帮你解读图片中的内容。如果你想解读药盒或查看皮肤状况，也可以告诉我哦。", "client_message_id": "3f8a9df6-529e-4973-8b44-07ee609f147d", "server_message_id": "4cd4150f-e2e4-4520-9324-d613c46eb5d2", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T05:08:27.519000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T05:08:27.462351+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "239955F8-613F-476B-B699-AE7A815D8CDB", "text": "show_custom_message_card", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "88AA9033-A7C9-463B-A72C-8BDD6EA7D8C1", "text": "[1] show_custom_message_card\n已展示上传/拍照卡片入口（report_photo），请继续引导用户上传材料。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "8EC363FB-99AF-4EEA-8952-3F301986A0E7", "text": "正在使用工具：show_custom_message_card", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "F616B19C-7544-4B96-B46F-61CD44795888", "text": "已展示上传/拍照卡片入口（report_photo），请继续引导用户上传材料。", "type": "operationalDescription"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "3131b90f-fd0b-49da-a491-af171d142d05", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "【图片附件】file_id=200 file_uuid=112C149D-13FF-4059-89E8-BBF09ED0FA88\nurl: (pending)\n【图片识别】\n09:03\nH！！！\n4G\n454\n商品\n评价\n推荐\n详情\n⑥2\n呵\n$A9\nSecminton\n邛\nEL1920.com\n产品参数\n商标：亚狮龙/RSL\n品名：羽毛球\nA9D\n型号：RSL A9D\nMHUTTIECOC\nR•S•L\nYaufminton\n400mm\n球头：复合软木\nJhuttlecat\n注：实际以包装信息为准\n毛片：羽毛\n注：实际以包装信息为准\n数量：12只球\n$A9\n尺寸：67x67x400mm\n67mm\n67mm\n注：手工测量可能存在一定误差，请以实物为准\n耐打\n羽毛球飞行稳定、毛片耐打\n不\n顶部\n加入购物车\n收藏\n\n【用户输入】\n这个是什么", "client_message_id": "0adc3050-3999-4f79-852c-48ed63d1e19e", "server_message_id": "c3d26888-572e-4f1a-9be3-8baaecd377e7", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T05:08:54.346000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T05:08:58.012607+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "B7B97DCE-0E25-4CA4-8959-DC18E2F62052", "text": "{\"file_md5\":\"fdd148f2f6050441d0188cc661c17f34\",\"mime_type\":\"application\\/octet-stream\",\"ocr_text\":\"09:03\\nH！！！\\n4G\\n454\\n商品\\n评价\\n推荐\\n详情\\n⑥2\\n呵\\n$A9\\nSecminton\\n邛\\nEL1920.com\\n产品参数\\n商标：亚狮龙\\/RSL\\n品名：羽毛球\\nA9D\\n型号：RSL A9D\\nMHUTTIECOC\\nR•S•L\\nYaufminton\\n400mm\\n球头：复合软木\\nJhuttlecat\\n注：实际以包装信息为准\\n毛片：羽毛\\n注：实际以包装信息为准\\n数量：12只球\\n$A9\\n尺寸：67x67x400mm\\n67mm\\n67mm\\n注：手工测量可能存在一定误差，请以实物为准\\n耐打\\n羽毛球飞行稳定、毛片耐打\\n不\\n顶部\\n加入购物车\\n收藏\",\"file_uuid\":\"112C149D-13FF-4059-89E8-BBF09ED0FA88\",\"file_id\":200,\"original_name\":\"照片 1\"}", "type": "image_url"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "3131b90f-fd0b-49da-a491-af171d142d05", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "根据图片识别内容，这是**亚狮龙（RSL）品牌的RSL A9D型号羽毛球**：\n- **包装规格**：一盒12只\n- **球头**：复合软木\n- **特点**：飞行稳定，毛片耐打\n\n是一款训练/娱乐用的羽毛球产品。", "client_message_id": "b5bb372a-47eb-4cf6-bc11-0dd52379c051", "server_message_id": "5f85de21-a59f-4cad-9677-a0d5603e9278", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T05:08:58.073000+00:00",