INFO 2026-04-17 11:33:07,647 accounts.api_io [request_id=C7C1851D-A31F-4E44-87BA-16B7A9AAE3F5] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=5 bytes=2557 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMTdUMDU6MjU6MTAuMDkwOTg0KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMDU0In0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "84d24c2e-b22d-4334-82d7-98bb44ecb2d6", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哥哥哥哥", "client_message_id": "73c21690-14eb-4e49-99f6-f15d68ea5047", "server_message_id": "3cca7c17-5316-4e49-9141-d08bb81ca423", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T05:25:05.544000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T05:25:10.076169+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "AF17BFCF-18BC-4F9C-8B4D-355001DA67E1", "text": "{\"file_id\":206,\"original_name\":\"照片 1\",\"mime_type\":\"application\\/octet-stream\",\"file_uuid\":\"915396FA-5427-4E35-B746-D8B9788971DA\",\"ocr_text\":\"12:20\\n：！！ 4G\\n8\\n9\\nMARTIN TUNGEVAAG\\n120w+\\nWicked Wonderland\\nTungevaag\\n关注\\n213人在听\\nの2\\nHQ VIP\\n原声\\nTo reappear on our front door\\n听伴奏\\n（9\\n01:17\\n03:37\\nC）\",\"file_md5\":\"0810b947ba5bafe40b199f2d646a283b\"}", "type": "image_url"}, {"id": "A1A41F96-CFE0-4F0E-8F30-97D36392E350", "text": "{\"file_id\":207,\"file_md5\":\"f51e639df490f28a34be60017757d0c0\",\"original_name\":\"照片 2\",\"mime_type\":\"application\\/octet-stream\",\"ocr_text\":\"中国移动\\n：！\\n87\\n4月16日周四•丙午年二月廿九\\n19:38\\n15°\\n多云\\n最高20°最低14°\\n也许你会陪我 看细水长流\\n红豆 一王菲\\n1:38\\n-2:38\",\"file_uuid\":\"6101D878-ACE8-421B-B96E-F284FDABA0CF\"}", "type": "image_url"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "84d24c2e-b22d-4334-82d7-98bb44ecb2d6", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好！我看到你分享了两张截图：\n\n1. **第一张**是音乐播放界面，正在播放 Martin Tungevaag 的《Wicked Wonderland》🎵\n2. **第二张**是手机锁屏界面，显示4月16日周四，天气多云15°C，正在播放王菲的《红豆》🎶\n\n有什么我可以帮你的吗？比如：\n- 想了解这些歌曲的信息？\n- 想记录今天的音乐心情？\n- 还是有其他健康相关的问题需要咨询？", "client_message_id": "5d9e22f4-283a-4013-a302-8c6bd299f2d5", "server_message_id": "ff2e6aff-19f2-45d2-ab6b-a5e0d99cde24", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T05:25:10.115000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T05:25:10.090984+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
