INFO 2026-04-17 11:44:27,967 accounts.api_io [request_id=A127C928-D63E-40A8-9EC1-6BB7E81ED602] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "192.168.31.39:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc2NDI3MzgyLCJpYXQiOjE3NzY0MjU1ODIsImp0aSI6ImI2YTUwMjUxNTI1MTRjMGM5MDFmZWM4NThmNzg2YjhhIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjQifQ.cLMTWsX-0gWKWQza_3gW7AhAG33jWjYyK6_aTibDO5E", "X-Request-Id": "A127C928-D63E-40A8-9EC1-6BB7E81ED602", "Content-Length": "2257"} body={"messages": [{"role": "user", "delivery_state": "pending", "content": "看看图片里面什么？", "attachments": [{"text": "{\"ocr_text\":\"QRAB 31150367\\n玄武湖水上运动基地\",\"original_name\":\"照片 4\",\"file_uuid\":\"63D55C96-7B3F-40C7-929A-D9343775C36F\",\"mime_type\":\"application\\/octet-stream\",\"file_md5\":\"6fd7e1c08f3e1d5a1da125ef01e602b1\",\"file_id\":222}", "id": "51B23395-11BD-4481-9222-006F3AF904BC", "type": "image_url", "imageDeliveryModeRaw": "directMultimodal"}], "client_message_id": "B7A3827A-4EFD-4F8B-A3D7-6CEB324338BC", "thread_id": "5B3C194D-28AC-4531-9D05-3143A91ABD55", "kind": "text", "created_at": "2026-04-17T11:44:13.763Z", "tombstone": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full", "reasoning_expanded": false}, {"kind": "text", "tombstone": false, "reasoning_content": "用户现在让我看看图片里有什么，我需要把看到的内容描述出来，首先地点是南京玄武湖对吧？先看前景：近处是玄武湖水上运动基地的小房子，牌子写着“玄武湖水上运动基地”，旁边有刚发芽的柳树，还有中国电信的监控箱。然后中景是玄武湖湖面，能看到一些小船。远景是南京的城市天际线，最显眼的是紫峰大厦，还有落日，整个氛围是黄昏时分，有点雾蒙蒙的，太阳是红橙色，天空是暖色调，看起来是日落时分的南京玄武湖景色。我整理一下，清晰说明。", "reasoning_expanded": false, "content": "这是**黄昏日落时分南京玄武湖的景色**，图中能看到：\n\n1.  **前景**：近处是「玄武湖水上运动基地」的小木屋，牌子清晰写着基地名称；右侧有一株刚发芽的柳树，右上角还有中国电信的公安监控配电箱。\n2.  **中景**：宽阔的玄武湖湖面，湖面上飘着几艘小船。\n3.  **远景**：雾气中的南京城市天际线，非常显眼的是南京地标**紫峰大厦**，一轮红日正落在城市建筑群间，整个画面暖调朦胧，氛围很治愈。", "created_at": "2026-04-17T11:44:28.019Z", "reasoning_visibility": "full", "reasoning_duration_ms": 4409, "thread_id": "5B3C194D-28AC-4531-9D05-3143A91ABD55", "role": "assistant", "delivery_state": "pending", "client_message_id": "85200C5B-4C9B-466E-9C6A-18E405E984A5", "attachments": []}]}
