INFO 2026-04-17 11:44:33,187 accounts.api_io [request_id=792D1E1F-BED6-4575-BB94-72F7B201F2D7] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=12 bytes=2680 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMTdUMTE6NDQ6MjcuOTk0MjI3KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMDgwIn0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "5b3c194d-28ac-4531-9d05-3143a91abd55", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "看看图片里面什么？", "client_message_id": "b7a3827a-4efd-4f8b-a3d7-6ceb324338bc", "server_message_id": "34540611-05c2-4571-b6ec-1be1a3138ffd", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T11:44:13.763000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T11:44:27.982735+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "51B23395-11BD-4481-9222-006F3AF904BC", "text": "{\"ocr_text\":\"QRAB 31150367\\n玄武湖水上运动基地\",\"original_name\":\"照片 4\",\"file_uuid\":\"63D55C96-7B3F-40C7-929A-D9343775C36F\",\"mime_type\":\"application\\/octet-stream\",\"file_md5\":\"6fd7e1c08f3e1d5a1da125ef01e602b1\",\"file_id\":222}", "type": "image_url", "imageDeliveryModeRaw": "directMultimodal"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5b3c194d-28ac-4531-9d05-3143a91abd55", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这是**黄昏日落时分南京玄武湖的景色**，图中能看到：\n\n1.  **前景**：近处是「玄武湖水上运动基地」的小木屋，牌子清晰写着基地名称；右侧有一株刚发芽的柳树，右上角还有中国电信的公安监控配电箱。\n2.  **中景**：宽阔的玄武湖湖面，湖面上飘着几艘小船。\n3.  **远景**：雾气中的南京城市天际线，非常显眼的是南京地标**紫峰大厦**，一轮红日正落在城市建筑群间，整个画面暖调朦胧，氛围很治愈。", "client_message_id": "85200c5b-4c9b-466e-9c6a-18e405e984a5", "server_message_id": "85d217f4-e8a9-44fd-bf46-43c6e8a37850", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T11:44:28.019000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T11:44:27.994227+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "用户现在让我看看图片里有什么，我需要把看到的内容描述出来，首先地点是南京玄武湖对吧？先看前景：近处是玄武湖水上运动基地的小房子，牌子写着“玄武湖水上运动基地”，旁边有刚发芽的柳树，还有中国电信的监控箱。然后中景是玄武湖湖面，能看到一些小船。远景是南京的城市天际线，最显眼的是紫峰大厦，还有落日，整个氛围是黄昏时分，有点雾蒙蒙的，太阳是红橙色，天空是暖色调，看起来是日落时分的南京玄武湖景色。我整理一下，清晰说明。", "reasoning_duration_ms": 4409, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
