n| **型号** | RSL A9D |\n| **规格** | 12只/筒 |\n| **球头** | 复合软木 |\n| **毛片** | 羽毛 |\n| **包装尺寸** | 67×67×400mm |\n\n## 产品卖点：\n- **耐打** — 宣传重点\n- 飞行稳定\n- 毛片耐打\n\n---\n\n您是想了解这款羽毛球的性价比、适不适合新手，还是在对比其他型号？🏸", "attachments": [], "created_at": "2026-04-17T12:02:13.223Z", "tombstone": false, "delivery_state": "pending", "client_message_id": "E253ADA1-8D28-4961-85F5-02328FFD9EEF", "reasoning_visibility": "full", "reasoning_expanded": false, "role": "assistant"}]}
