INFO 2026-04-17 12:44:13,470 accounts.api_io [request_id=5A63F9EC-0D1A-4B68-8DCF-55D0C4DB4D6A] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=12 bytes=8531 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMTZUMDI6NTY6MTguNDA3ODAzKzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI5ODIifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "8ada5b84-70ae-4657-944e-3acb303ae20a", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀", "client_message_id": "1558ec02-ae3b-44f8-8a6e-8c46d2f57f47", "server_message_id": "b754b5a3-cf46-4bdc-96f4-c01e9c14ae24", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-16T02:55:01.252000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-16T02:55:09.425483+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "8ada5b84-70ae-4657-944e-3acb303ae20a", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好！很高兴见到你 😊 我是 Spark 健康助手，可以帮你：\n\n- 📊 **健康数据追踪** — 步数、睡眠、运动、饮食、能量消耗\n- 💊 **用药与病历管理** — 记录用药、整理检查报告\n- 📅 **日程与提醒** — 设置健康相关的日历和提醒\n- 📍 **位置与天气** — 查询位置、规划路线、查看天气\n- 🔍 **知识检索** — 搜索健康知识和在线信息\n- 📝 **任务管理** — 创建健康相关的待办任务\n\n有什么我可以帮你的吗？比如：\n- 查看今天的步数或睡眠情况？\n- 记录一次饮食或运动？\n- 设置一个健康提醒？\n- 或者有任何健康相关的问题想聊聊？", "client_message_id": "8744b85b-5b21-4fca-90ba-54752c979cd6", "server_message_id": "2ad27f72-fb7a-4dce-9026-d18020c45821", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-16T02:55:09.424000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-16T02:55:09.433477+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "8ada5b84-70ae-4657-944e-3acb303ae20a", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "帮我新建一个 运动任务 我喜欢打羽毛球", "client_message_id": "e110a2ea-df45-4712-9d3f-11388e45faa3", "server_message_id": "12dffc34-55fa-4989-83c8-0bdd5965265e", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-16T02:55:45.565000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-16T02:56:02.944826+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "8ada5b84-70ae-4657-944e-3acb303ae20a", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "好的！我来帮你创建一个羽毛球运动任务 🏸\n\n根据你的需求，我为你生成了一个运动任务卡片：\n\n---\n\n### 🏸 待确认任务\n\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| **任务名称** | 打羽毛球 |\n| **任务类型** | 运动/锻炼 |\n| **建议频率** | 每周 2-3 次 |\n| **单次时长** | 45-60 分钟 |\n| **运动强度** | 中等强度有氧运动 |\n\n---\n\n### 💡 羽毛球运动小贴士：\n\n1. **热身准备** — 运动前做 5-10 分钟关节活动和拉伸\n2. **装备建议** — 穿防滑运动鞋，使用合适的球拍\n3. **补水提醒** — 运动中适量补水，避免脱水\n4. **运动时机** — 饭后 1-2 小时再进行剧烈运动\n5. **放松恢复** — 运动后做拉伸，帮助肌肉恢复\n\n---\n\n请问你想：\n- ✅ **确认创建** 这个任务？\n- 📝 **修改任务** 详情（比如设置具体时间、频率）？\n- ⏰ **添加提醒** 来督促自己坚持运动？\n\n告诉我你的需求，我来帮你完善！", "client_message_id": "8c83a83f-2a3d-44b8-aef2-35c8954f8c62", "server_message_id": "8aaedbff-cc12-4121-9ad3-84067c547954", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-16T02:56:02.916000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-16T02:56:18.407803+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "45886AD0-02F1-4834-9528-F51815D12334", "text": "generate_task, query_tasks_by_member", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "8C332EEF-B9BE-4137-B61A-21BDC3F3C78B", "text": "[1] query_tasks_by_member\n{\"ok\":true,\"member_id\":18,\"total\":0,\"queried_at\":\"2026-04-16T02:55:48.394Z\",\"tasks\":[]}\n\n[2] generate_task\n{\"task_cards\":[{\"task_payload\":{\"task\":\"{\\\"creator_id\\\":\\\"current_user\\\",\\\"due_time\\\":\\\"2026-04-17T02:55:53.039Z\\\",\\\"type\\\":1,\\\"status\\\":0,\\\"source\\\":1,\\\"repeat_type\\\":0,\\\"start_time\\\":\\\"2026-04-16T02:55:53.039Z\\\",\\\"priority\\\":1,\\\"member_id\\\":18}\",\"task_exercise\":\"{\\\"exercise_type\\\":\\\"打羽毛球\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"活动量提升\\\",\\\"duration_min\\\":30,\\\"intensity\\\":\\\"medium\\\"}\"},\"type\":1,\"title\":\"运动任务\",\"repeat_type\":0,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-16T02:55:53.039Z\",\"priority\":1,\"business_type\":\"ai_task_generation\",\"member\":18,\"due_time\":\"2026-04-17T02:55:53.039Z\",\"extract_payload\":{\"task_type\":\"exercise\",\"frequency\":\"\",\"period\":\"none\",\"intensity_or_value\":\"\",\"target_metric\":\"\",\"start_time\":\"\",\"action\":\"打羽毛球\",\"confidence\":\"0.80\"},\"source\":1,\"id\":-1776308153,\"created_at\":\"2026-04-16T02:55:53.039Z\",\"status\":0,\"business_id\":\"\",\"similarity_payload\":{\"similar_count\":\"0\",\"queried_first\":\"true\",\"member_source\":\"current_member_default\"},\"start_time\":\"2026-04-16T02:55:53.039Z\",\"ignored_reason\":\"\",\"description\":\"目标：活动量提升\\n动作：打羽毛球\\n计划：daily\\n强度：30 分钟\"}]}", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "FED93709-6E88-4D59-9324-3987F33732AB", "text": "正在使用工具：generate_task, query_tasks_by_member", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "C7189583-200E-4907-BA2F-319966F3B6F9", "text": "{\"ok\":true,\"member_id\":18,\"total\":0,\"queried_at\":\"2026-04-16T02:55:48.394Z\",\"tasks\":[]}\n[2] generate_task\n{\"task_cards\":[{\"task_payload\":{\"task\":\"{\\\"creator_id\\\":\\\"current_user\\\",\\\"due_time\\\":\\\"2026-04-17T02:55:53.039Z\\\",\\\"type\\\":1,\\\"status\\\":0,\\\"source\\\":1,\\\"repeat_type\\\":0,\\\"start_time\\\":\\\"2026-04-16T02:55:53.039Z\\\",\\\"priority\\\":1,\\\"member_id\\\":18}\",\"task_exercise\":\"{\\\"exercise_type\\\":\\\"打羽毛球\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"活动量提升\\\",\\\"duration_min\\\":30,\\\"intensity\\\":\\\"medium\\\"}\"},\"type\":1,\"title\":\"运动任务\",\"repeat_type\":0,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-16T02:55:53.039Z\",\"priority\":1,\"business_type\":\"ai_task_generation\",\"member\":18,\"due_time\":\"2026-04-17T02:55:53.039Z\",\"extract_payload\":{\"task_type\":\"exercise\",\"frequency\":\"\",\"period\":\"none\",\"intensity_or_value\":\"\",\"target_metric\":\"\",\"start_time\":\"\",\"action\":\"打羽毛球\",\"confidence\":\"0.80\"},\"source\":1,\"id\":-1776308153,\"created_at\":\"2026-04-16T02:55:53.039Z