INFO 2026-04-17 12:44:13,627 accounts.api_io [request_id=176DF7DB-E50C-4304-B55F-751383E0022E] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=13 bytes=5517 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMTZUMDg6MzQ6MTcuODI4MDkwKzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMDE1In0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "ac5708ff-b90a-4bd8-9970-57c0b390fbd1", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "hi wchat？", "client_message_id": "ad1dbc61-a645-472c-98b1-c3d8308b7b3e", "server_message_id": "dc7d1327-3692-4028-841a-d6dfdabc7f69", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-16T05:37:20.684000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-16T05:37:25.077218+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "ac5708ff-b90a-4bd8-9970-57c0b390fbd1", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好！我是 Spark 健康助手，可以帮助你：\n\n- 📊 查看健康数据（步数、睡眠、运动、营养）\n- 💊 管理用药和医疗记录\n- 🗓️ 安排日程和提醒\n- 📍 查找地点和规划路线\n- 🌤️ 查询天气\n- 🔍 搜索健康知识和资讯\n\n有什么我可以帮你的吗？😊", "client_message_id": "025e29df-d26f-4760-b918-d1e3a0e73db6", "server_message_id": "2345397c-aa04-4d03-97b5-0736325a50a6", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-16T05:37:25.042000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-16T05:37:25.084204+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "ac5708ff-b90a-4bd8-9970-57c0b390fbd1", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "不错不错", "client_message_id": "253e61b0-c2c6-4631-a358-185a95ce746e", "server_message_id": "c822010b-f925-47b7-9d17-de567c1b43c9", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-16T08:32:19.247000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-16T08:33:07.457671+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "ac5708ff-b90a-4bd8-9970-57c0b390fbd1", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "大麦", "client_message_id": "79e46cb2-c91c-419e-9b49-09943955b803", "server_message_id": "4e5b6afc-2e10-4faa-a855-3dac3e5267f9", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-16T08:32:44.975000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-16T08:33:07.470144+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "ac5708ff-b90a-4bd8-9970-57c0b390fbd1", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "没那么", "client_message_id": "8dde8278-ed25-4a3a-8158-3f0cf9eb4bb4", "server_message_id": "4a7f8f6a-770b-4542-975d-7e96dee8dedc", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-16T08:33:01.861000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-16T08:33:07.474464+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "ac5708ff-b90a-4bd8-9970-57c0b390fbd1", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "听起来你想说的是\"没那么简单\"？😉 你有什么具体需求吗？可以告诉我你想做什么，比如：\n- 查看近期的运动/睡眠数据\n- 记录饮食或用药\n- 查询健康相关知识\n- 安排日程提醒\n\n我会尽力帮你解决问题~", "client_message_id": "3eac7aeb-6b7f-4d34-9144-0519df464fbd", "server_message_id": "1a35aead-c825-4432-995f-7d4e09024dfd", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-16T08:33:07.270000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-16T08:33:07.478458+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "ac5708ff-b90a-4bd8-9970-57c0b390fbd1", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "从vv", "client_message_id": "143d2529-efde-436e-9524-1165383fc4e8", "server_message_id": "b48a20f0-059c-4b7f-b880-987a98ee5762", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-16T08:33:11.047000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-16T08:34:17.812727+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "ac5708ff-b90a-4bd8-9970-57c0b390fbd1", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈", "client_message_id": "99c47f1f-381e-4164-a002-7bcdbc58111d", "server_message_id": "653ccf5b-6c7e-442a-9434-5fe2d9464eca", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-16T08:34:16+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-16T08:34:17.821801+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "ac5708ff-b90a-4bd8-9970-57c0b390fbd1", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈，看来你心情不错！😄 有什么我可以帮你的吗？无论是健康数据查询、日程安排，还是其他问题，随时告诉我哦~", "client_message_id": "1efec528-8df7-48d9-be4b-53783739ae28", "server_message_id": "930ea35e-5f47-420a-9218-513a286648ec", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-16T08:34:17.769000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-16T08:34:17.828090+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "用户似乎在开玩笑或者测试我的反应。他们说\"哈哈\"，表示他们在笑或者觉得有趣。我应该友好地回应，保持轻松愉快的氛围，同时继续提供帮助。", "reasoning_duration_ms": 303, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
