INFO 2026-04-17 12:44:13,985 accounts.api_io [request_id=405327FF-0994-40A5-95F2-7E8A37FE4E41] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=5 bytes=7051 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMTdUMTI6MDI6MTMuMTUxNTIxKzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMDgyIn0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "5b3c194d-28ac-4531-9d05-3143a91abd55", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "这是什么", "client_message_id": "45503568-36c8-43e6-8895-a6639dd2e10c", "server_message_id": "8c215fa2-29b6-4e82-aea3-802fd99f1919", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T11:41:59.944000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T11:42:05.468265+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "21CC68D1-2496-42AD-A4B2-D98BAA5151D3", "text": "{\"file_md5\":\"20e69b71f21688e68b7716f48d6de8ce\",\"file_id\":218,\"original_name\":\"照片 1\",\"mime_type\":\"application\\/octet-stream\",\"ocr_text\":\"\",\"file_uuid\":\"FE2752AA-AE1D-4AA5-AC1C-2C84C8033C6B\"}", "type": "image_url", "imageDeliveryModeRaw": "direct_multimodal"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5b3c194d-28ac-4531-9d05-3143a91abd55", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这是一只**可爱的卡通鲸鱼** 🐳\n\n这是一幅插画风格的图片，描绘了一只：\n- **天蓝色**的圆润身体\n- **眯着眼睛**、表情安详（好像在微笑或休息）\n- **头顶喷出水花**（鲸鱼喷水的典型特征）\n- **白色腹部**带有条纹\n- 整体风格**圆润可爱**，像是一个吉祥物或表情包形象\n\n这只鲸鱼看起来心情很好，给人一种**放松、治愈**的感觉 😊\n\n---\n\n请问您上传这张图片是想了解什么？或者需要我帮您做什么？", "client_message_id": "e2fbd40f-1c72-41f0-9337-2a9b886de435", "server_message_id": "e148ad63-0a02-4d89-b9cd-2117055daa74", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T11:42:05.532000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T11:42:05.478716+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5b3c194d-28ac-4531-9d05-3143a91abd55", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "看看图片里面什么？", "client_message_id": "b7a3827a-4efd-4f8b-a3d7-6ceb324338bc", "server_message_id": "34540611-05c2-4571-b6ec-1be1a3138ffd", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T11:44:13.763000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T11:44:27.982735+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "51B23395-11BD-4481-9222-006F3AF904BC", "text": "{\"ocr_text\":\"QRAB 31150367\\n玄武湖水上运动基地\",\"original_name\":\"照片 4\",\"file_uuid\":\"63D55C96-7B3F-40C7-929A-D9343775C36F\",\"mime_type\":\"application\\/octet-stream\",\"file_md5\":\"6fd7e1c08f3e1d5a1da125ef01e602b1\",\"file_id\":222}", "type": "image_url", "imageDeliveryModeRaw": "directMultimodal"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5b3c194d-28ac-4531-9d05-3143a91abd55", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这是**黄昏日落时分南京玄武湖的景色**，图中能看到：\n\n1.  **前景**：近处是「玄武湖水上运动基地」的小木屋，牌子清晰写着基地名称；右侧有一株刚发芽的柳树，右上角还有中国电信的公安监控配电箱。\n2.  **中景**：宽阔的玄武湖湖面，湖面上飘着几艘小船。\n3.  **远景**：雾气中的南京城市天际线，非常显眼的是南京地标**紫峰大厦**，一轮红日正落在城市建筑群间，整个画面暖调朦胧，氛围很治愈。", "client_message_id": "85200c5b-4c9b-466e-9c6a-18e405e984a5", "server_message_id": "85d217f4-e8a9-44fd-bf46-43c6e8a37850", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T11:44:28.019000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T11:44:27.994227+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "用户现在让我看看图片里有什么，我需要把看到的内容描述出来，首先地点是南京玄武湖对吧？先看前景：近处是玄武湖水上运动基地的小房子，牌子写着“玄武湖水上运动基地”，旁边有刚发芽的柳树，还有中国电信的监控箱。然后中景是玄武湖湖面，能看到一些小船。远景是南京的城市天际线，最显眼的是紫峰大厦，还有落日，整个氛围是黄昏时分，有点雾蒙蒙的，太阳是红橙色，天空是暖色调，看起来是日落时分的南京玄武湖景色。我整理一下，清晰说明。", "reasoning_duration_ms": 4409, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5b3c194d-28ac-4531-9d05-3143a91abd55", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈哈", "client_message_id": "05236213-0227-4419-8925-cf56c4eb6472", "server_message_id": "756b0b11-643a-45b8-a816-44e8e15e110f", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T12:01:57.368000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T12:02:13.141374+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "74032768-CA5E-4F4F-98C6-AECE485D5E25", "text": "{\"file_md5\":\"fdd148f2f6050441d0188cc661c17f34\",\"mime_type\":\"application\\/octet-stream\",\"ocr_text\":\"09:03\\nH！！！\\n4G\\n454\\n商品\\n评价\\n推荐\\n详情\\n⑥2\\n呵\\n$A9\\nSecminton\\n邛\\nEL1920.com\\n产品参数\\n商标：亚狮龙\\/RSL\\n品名：羽毛球\\nA9D\\n型号：RSL A9D\\nMHUTTIECOC\\nR•S•L\\nYaufminton\\n400mm\\n球头：复合软木\\nJhuttlecat\\n注：实际以包装信息为准\\n毛片：羽毛\\n注：实际以包装信息为准\\n数量：12只球\\n$A9\\n尺寸：67x67x400mm\\n67mm\\n67mm\\n注：手工测量可能存在一定误差，请以实物为准\\n耐打\\n羽毛球飞行稳定、毛片耐打\\n不\\n顶部\\n加入购物车\\n收藏\",\"file_id\":223,\"original_name\":\"照片 1\",\"file_uuid\":\"A5CCC3F8-276E-4F8A-973C-203984624F0E\"}", "type": "image_url", "imageDeliveryModeRaw": "directMultimodal"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5b3c194d-28ac-4531-9d05-3143a91abd55", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这是**亚狮龙（RSL）A9D 羽毛球**的商品详情页截图，来自某个购物App（可能是京东或淘宝）。\n\n## 产品信息一览：\n\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| **品牌** | 亚狮龙 / RSL（英国老牌羽毛球品牌） |\n| **型号** | RSL A9D |\n| **规格** | 12只/筒 |\n| **球头** | 复合软木 |\n| **毛片** | 羽毛 |\n| **包装尺寸** | 67×67×400mm |\n\n## 产品卖点：\n- **耐打** — 宣传重点\n- 飞行稳定\n- 毛片耐打\n\n---\n\n您是想了解这款羽毛球的性价比、适不适合新手，还是在对比其他型号？🏸", "client_message_id": "e253ada1-8d28-4961-85f5-02328ffd9eef", "server_message_id": "2d62b75c-6a52-4ea1-9c5c-326191ca80d8", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T12:02:13.223000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T12:02:13.151521+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
