INFO 2026-04-17 14:14:18,513 accounts.api_io [request_id=C892AFFF-ED56-47D3-91CC-09A3F5B90103] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "192.168.31.39:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc2NDM1NTg2LCJpYXQiOjE3NzY0MzM3ODYsImp0aSI6ImExYmM0NDI5ZTI4ZjQ2ZDI4ZDQxZTZlZDk1ODA1Y2RjIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjYifQ.heJRV8P9_fmuZtPk1x9vRbAxb6YNxqydaAGHYHK2QsY", "X-Request-Id": "C892AFFF-ED56-47D3-91CC-09A3F5B90103", "Content-Length": "1439"} body={"messages": [{"content": "得到的", "tombstone": false, "delivery_state": "pending", "role": "user", "client_message_id": "DE65CB67-0BDE-4B0B-BC0A-C7DEA4A902EF", "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full", "thread_id": "229F3622-5AE0-490D-A0B0-004E58E31AEF", "attachments": [], "kind": "text", "created_at": "2026-04-17T14:14:12.294Z"}, {"content": "你是说已经拿到胃镜报告结果了是吗？从报告来看，诊断是**慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流**，这是临床上很常见的胃部问题，不用太焦虑，给你几点建议：\n\n1.  **诊疗建议**：报告已经取了活检，记得3-5个工作日后跟进病理结果，拿着报告去消化内科门诊，医生会根据你的症状开具抑酸、促动力或保护胃黏膜的药物\n2.  **生活调整**：\n    - 餐后避免立即平躺，睡前2-3小时尽量不要进食\n    - 少吃油腻、辛辣刺激和甜食，这些容易加重胆汁反流\n    - 如果有抽烟饮酒习惯，建议尽量戒除\n3.  **定期复查**：遵医嘱定期复查胃镜，观察炎症变化\n\n你目前有胃痛、胃胀、反酸这些不舒服的症状吗？", "tombstone": false, "delivery_state": "pending", "role": "assistant", "client_message_id": "91D77FEE-9C28-4603-B008-B4F2C343AD41", "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full", "thread_id": "229F3622-5AE0-490D-A0B0-004E58E31AEF", "attachments": [], "kind": "text", "created_at": "2026-04-17T14:14:18.506Z"}]}
