aef", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "我的", "client_message_id": "cbf3aad3-57be-4206-9e4d-f4d9ad35f2f9", "server_message_id": "0f8ecdd8-b57b-41ec-8003-21c7d02a5129", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T14:13:03.636000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T14:13:08.076500+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "79ABD52E-7CD0-47CA-A689-B1A6257BC1FB", "type": "image_url", "payload": {"kind": "image_ref", "version": 1, "image_ref": {"size": 352409, "file_id": 236, "file_md5": "0810b947ba5bafe40b199f2d646a283b", "ocr_text": "12:20\n：！！ 4G\n8\n9\nMARTIN TUNGEVAAG\n120w+\nWicked Wonderland\nTungevaag\n关注\n213人在听\nの2\nHQ VIP\n原声\nTo reappear on our front door\n听伴奏\n（9\n01:17\n03:37\nC）", "file_uuid": "B00A8AAF-A3CB-43B8-A2A2-505493C7ED4E", "mime_type": "application/octet-stream", "object_key": "SparkClient/20260417/B00A8AAF-A3CB-43B8-A2A2-505493C7ED4E/照片 1", "storage_type": "oss", "original_name": "照片 1"}}, "imageDeliveryModeRaw": "directMultimodal"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "229f3622-5ae0-490d-a0b0-004e58e31aef", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你正在听Tungevaag的《Wicked Wonderland》🎵，这首电鼓点节奏超带感，适合运动或者放松的时候听～你是在分享喜欢的音乐吗😊？", "client_message_id": "b0518f2c-2182-4932-ae44-4cde0f8b66ba", "server_message_id": "ec74b2f9-4542-4d51-b1b3-746d4f48efce", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T14:13:08.041000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T14:13:08.092526+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "229f3622-5ae0-490d-a0b0-004e58e31aef", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "？", "client_message_id": "4d73a3bd-4daf-49f9-9e1a-89020d58d6f1", "server_message_id": "6c088ff5-36cf-4896-ba5f-42350bd6d49a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T14:13:44.331000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T14:13:47.056755+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "229f3622-5ae0-490d-a0b0-004e58e31aef", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "抱歉理解错了😅，你是想让我帮忙看看这张截图里的内容，还是需要其他帮助呢？可以告诉我你的需求哦。", "client_message_id": "32fa97e4-ad7d-4401-8180-b70ea0f7eb29", "server_message_id": "bd1cf95b-90d9-48e8-a3a3-36bdfdf0442d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T14:13:47.006000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T14:13:47.067950+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "229f3622-5ae0-490d-a0b0-004e58e31aef", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "怪怪的", "client_message_id": "142d8f8e-bb99-4fbd-ab16-221c91d5178e", "server_message_id": "8d56abd1-b28d-4843-961c-1a856074cf08", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T14:13:52.424000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T14:13:55.757575+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "229f3622-5ae0-490d-a0b0-004e58e31aef", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你是说感觉哪里怪怪的？是身体不舒服还是对刚才胃镜报告的结果有疑问呀？可以具体说一下你的感受，我帮你分析看看~", "client_message_id": "c15faa3b-ca0c-4392-8520-66ca3990f875", "server_message_id": "04089064-394f-4da3-a55f-51733cbcf4fa", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T14:13:55.747000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T14:13:55.763028+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "229f3622-5ae0-490d-a0b0-004e58e31aef", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈哈", "client_message_id": "92c84021-bda7-456d-a480-c515c99e5389", "server_message_id": "1e9c89fa-f256-423c-81f8-dc0b49b0c6ab", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T14:13:59.546000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T14:14:03.703144+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "229f3622-5ae0-490d-a0b0-004e58e31aef", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "看来是我误会啦😆！你是在开玩笑逗我呀～那如果之后有健康相关的问题，随时找我就好啦！", "client_message_id": "2a154192-f95c-41f2-b9f7-ebe6394fbdf9", "server_message_id": "b4fa435f-adeb-4ff8-8eab-cb380a22a210", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T14:14:03.670000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T14:14:03.711648+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "229f3622-5ae0-490d-a0b0-004e58e31aef", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "得到的", "client_message_id": "de65cb67-0bde-4b0b-bc0a-c7dea4a902ef", "server_message_id": "e69573a8-1fd6-48c6-9b92-c8b6ae7ff459", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T14:14:12.294000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T14:14:18.539606+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "229f3622-5ae0-490d-a0b0-004e58e31aef", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你是说已经拿到胃镜报告结果了是吗？从报告来看，诊断是**慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流**，这是临床上很常见的胃部问题，不用太焦虑，给你几点建议：\n\n1.  **诊疗建议**：报告已经取了活检，记得3-5个工作日后跟进病理结果，拿着报告去消化内科门诊，医生会根据你的症状开具抑酸、促动力或保护胃黏膜的药物\n2.  **生活调整**：\n    - 餐后避免立即平躺，睡前2-3小时尽量不要进食\n    - 少吃油腻、辛辣刺激和甜食，这些容易加重胆汁反流\n    - 如果有抽烟饮酒习惯，建议尽量戒除\n3.  **定期复查**：遵医嘱定期复查胃镜，观察炎症变化\n\n你目前有胃痛、胃胀、反酸这些不舒服的症状吗？", "client_message_id": "91d77fee-9c28-4603-b008-b4f2c343ad41", "server_message_id": "3b7431bd-39c6-4fa0-88b3-7ba73a236985", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T14:14:18.506000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T14:14:18.556836+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
